OL,3,GNEWSACentury-old baby death mystery
OL,4,Achallenged detectives
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe detective who led the investigation
OL,7,Finto the death of a baby found beneath
OL,8,Ffloorboards and wrapped in a 1910
OL,9,Fnewspaper said officers had to "think
OL,10,Foutside the box" to try and solve the
OL,11,Fcase.
OL,13,FThe skeleton of the full-term boy with
OL,14,Fa twine round his neck was discovered
OL,15,Fduring the renovation of a building on
OL,16,FBishop Auckland's Fore Bondgate in July
OL,17,F2024.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
