OL,3,GNEWSACentury-old baby death mystery
OL,4,Achallenged detectives
OL,5,
OL,6,FCounty Durham and Darlington Coroner
OL,7,FCrispin Oliver concluded he was most
OL,8,Flikely garroted shortly after being
OL,9,Fborn in about 1910, with his body then
OL,10,Fconcealed.
OL,12,FDet Ch Insp Mel Sutherland of Durham
OL,13,FPolice said it was a frustrating but
OL,14,Frewarding investigation.
